                "description": "The Minneapolis Mortise Handleset was made to grace the front door of a modern home in a big city; but even if you don't live in an urban landscape, this modern handleset is perfect to bring Minneapolis glamour to any home. It is available as a single cylinder, double cylinder, or full dummy set. This Contemporary Mortise Minneapolis Handleset with 5190 Lever is available in a huge selection of modern finishes.\r\n",
